med, those requests are added to your account and Trips says &quot;We found earlier requests made with your email&quot;.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="start-here-stuck-on-a-page" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Stuck on a page?</h2><p class="gd-p">If you spend a few minutes on a page without anything saving, see the same error three times, or go back and forth between the same two steps, a small box asks <b class="gd-ui">Need a hand with</b> the page. <b class="gd-ui">Open the guide section</b> opens this guide at the right chapter beside the page (a sheet from the bottom on a phone); <b class="gd-ui">Back to what I was doing</b> closes it and everything you typed is still there. <b class="gd-ui">Not now</b> quiets it on that page for a day. It never shows while you pay or sign.</p></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('owner', 'start-here', 'start', null, '### Who this guide is for

Owners who list one or more cars with CarmaCars, whether Managed, Self-managed or Turo only. Your portal shows each car, its bookings, your invoices, statements and payouts, and every form to sign.

### What you need

- The email address you applied or were invited with
- Each car''s VIN, ownership permit and insurance details
- A Canadian bank account for your fees and payouts

## Your first sign-in

1. New to CarmaCars? Apply at `carmacars.ca/list-your-car`. Your account is made at the end of the application: open the email "Confirm your CarmaCars account" within 24 hours and its link opens your owner portal.
2. Invited by us? Open the invitation email within 24 hours, choose a password and press **Save the new password**.
3. Next time, go to `carmacars.ca/sign-in`, enter your Email and Password and press **Sign in**.
4. Forgot your password? Press **Forgot your password?** on the sign-in page and follow the email.
5. Rather use your phone? Press **Use my phone number instead** on the sign-in page, enter your mobile number and the 6-digit code we text you. Add and verify your number first under **Account** > **Profile**, Sign-in, so it opens your owner portal.

![](/guides/img/public-09-sign-in-phone-1f766061.jpg "phone; size: 390 645; pins: 3 95.4 78.4")

> Good to know: Email links work for 24 hours, once. If a link has expired, the page it opens has **Send me a new link**.
