Add-on revenue is CarmaCars'' own. It is never in a commission: your commission stays on the rental charge.
',
  '<p class="gd-p">Renters buy add-ons with a rental: seats, flowers, a chauffeur, an umbrella, a phone charger, a full tank. You add them in offers and rentals, confirm the ones that need it, and Fleet keeps the stock.</p><section class="gd-task" id="add-ons-in-an-offer-or-a-rental-you-add" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">In an offer or a rental you add</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On the review screen of a request, under Add-ons, tick or count what the renter wants. The price on the right follows. Choose the hours for a chauffeur.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Add-ons the renter asked for are already ticked. One waiting for confirmation (a chauffeur) is confirmed when you keep it and send the offer; untick it to remove it.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">In <b class="gd-ui">Bookings</b>, the <b class="gd-ui">Add a rental</b> button, the Add-ons list sits under The rental: tick them before you press <b class="gd-ui">Check the calendar and the price</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Notice is yours to judge: you may add flowers with less than 24 hours if Fleet can do it.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="add-ons-after-booking" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">After booking</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">The booking page shows the add-ons, paid or not, and any waiting for confirmation.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">A renter asked for a chauffeur from their portal: you get a task. Press <b class="gd-ui">Confirm and charge</b> (the card on file is charged) or <b class="gd-ui">Decline</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Remove</b> and give the reason to take one off. Unpaid, it goes; paid, a refund for it waits for approval.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="add-ons-fleet-tasks-and-stock" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Fleet: tasks and stock</h2><p class="gd-p">Flowers and a chauffeur give Fleet a task to get them ready, due before pickup by their notice.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Cars</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Add-ons</b>. Each add-on shows its price, its notice and how many are booked in the next 30 days.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">For seats, umbrellas and chargers, type how many we have under In stock and press <b class="gd-ui">Save</b>. Renters cannot ask for more than are free for their dates.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">A confirmed booking with more than we have gives you an urgent task: find another or tell the renter.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">Add-on revenue is CarmaCars&#39; own. It is never in a commission: your commission stays on the rental charge.</p></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('va', 'quick-reference', 'reference', 'shared-tools', '### Where things are

| Item | What it is for |
| --- | --- |
| **To do** | Next up, your lanes with their timers, then every open task |
| **Today at a glance** | The second tab of To do: pickups, returns, what is due |
| **Working as** | Switch function (above the menu) |
| **Customer service** | Requests, Live chat, Messages, Send an offer, Live visitors; More customer service |
| **Finance** | Money to handle, Payments by day, Tolls and tickets, Reconciliation, Turo trips; More finance |
| **Fleet** | Field jobs, Daily checks, Photo reviews, Maintenance, Listings; More fleet |
| **Sales** | Requests and offers, Send an offer, New quote, Live chat, My sales; More sales |
| **Add a rental, New quote** | Every function |
| **My numbers** | Scorecard (your results by week) and My sales (commissions, quotes, offers, bookings) |

### Top tasks

1. *Take a task:* **To do**, **Take it**, then **Done**
2. *Send an offer:* **Requests**, the booking, then **Send the offer**
3. *Quote a caller:* **Bookings**, the **New quote** tab, then **Create the request**
4. *See your sales:* **Me**, the **My sales** tab, then **By week** or **By month**
5. *Claim a client you found:* **I sourced this client** when you add the rental or send the offer
6. *Review Forms C and D:* **Owner forms** > **Approve**
7. *Read a toll notice:* **Tolls and tickets** > **Read a notice**
8. *Issue a refund:* **Request the refund**, **Issue the refund**
9. *Schedule a field job:* **Field jobs** > **Schedule**
10. *Cover a plate:* **Cover the plate**, **Save the covered photo**

### If something goes wrong

| What you see | What to do |
| --- | --- |
| **A link says it expired** | Links in our emails work for 24 hours, once. Press **Send me a new link** on that page. |
| **"Error 1102" on a page** | A short limit on our web host. Reload the page. You are still signed in. |
| **"That email and password do not match an account."** | Check the address, or use **Set a new password** on the sign-in page. |
| **A task is above your limit** | Press **Escalate** and say why. An Admin picks it up. |
| **Asked for a 6-digit code** | Open your authenticator app. Lost your phone? Tell an Admin. |
