3. When you arrive, press **End the move**, fill in Now at and the odometer, then press **End the move now**.

## Documents to sign

Your staff agreement, when CarmaCars sends it.

1. My jobs shows "You have a document to sign". Press **Read and sign**.
2. Check the key values at the top (your role, wage and start date), then press **Read the PDF** and read it.
3. Sign in a few steps: press **Send the code** and type the 6-digit code from your phone or email, tick that you read it, draw your initials beside the key terms (confidentiality, the rules on money, keys and cars, ending the agreement), tick the two consents and draw your signature.
4. Press **Sign**. The signed copy, with its certificate of completion, stays on the same page.

## Cars now

**Field work** > **Cars now** shows which cars are out, coming back today and tomorrow, going out in the next 72 hours and free, with no money. The renter''s phone shows only on your own jobs.


## Call and text the renter

**Call** on a job opens the Quo app with the renter''s number, so the call comes from the CarmaCars number; **Text** opens a small window that sends from the CarmaCars number and keeps the text with the booking. Without the Quo app, use **Use this phone** in the window that opens.',
  '<p class="gd-p">Your day, in order: handovers, returns, deliveries, moves and photo shoots. Each job card has the car, the plate, the place and the time.</p><section class="gd-task" id="my-jobs-your-job-list" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your job list</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">The menu: <b class="gd-ui">My jobs</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Cars now</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Map</b> (where the cars of your jobs are now, with their trips and alerts), <b class="gd-ui">My hours</b> and <b class="gd-ui">Me</b> (My sales, Referrals, Profile and Academy, as a row on top). <b class="gd-ui">Add a rental</b> and <b class="gd-ui">Report a problem</b> are buttons at the top of My jobs. <b class="gd-ui">Sign out</b> is top right.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Switch between <b class="gd-ui">Today</b> and <b class="gd-ui">Tomorrow</b>. Jobs are in time order.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">The next job is the big card at the top: its time and how long until it, the car and its plate, the place with <b class="gd-ui">Open in maps</b> and a button to call the renter, and what to put in the car. The rest of the day follows in time order.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">A handover or a return has its own button: <b class="gd-ui">Check out (pickup)</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Check in (return)</b>. One tap acknowledges and starts the job and opens its photo checklist. Other jobs: press <b class="gd-ui">Open the job</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Moving a car that has no job? Use Vehicle moves (see below).</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/1530"><img src="/guides/img/field-01-today-phone-b31e25fb.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="1530"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:91%;top:15%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:89.7%;top:53.3%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:89.7%;top:61.4%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:89.7%;top:88.2%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>Need help on a job? Call CarmaCars at 289-312-5991. The link is at the bottom of My jobs.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="my-jobs-open-a-job" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Open a job</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">The card shows the kind, the time, the car, the plate and colour.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">The address, with <b class="gd-ui">Open in maps</b> for directions, and a button to call the renter.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">For a handover: the booking, the renter&#39;s name and phone, the Card on File and the licence on file.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Acknowledge</b> so the office knows you have it. Then press <b class="gd-ui">Start</b> when you are with the car.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/1530"><img src="/guides/img/field-02-job-phone-c6780f54.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="1530"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:94.9%;top:34%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:94.9%;top:44.1%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:94.9%;top:52.6%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:94.9%;top:95.8%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="my-jobs-check-the-renter-s-licence" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Check the renter&#39;s licence</h2><p class="gd-p">The renter&#39;s licence photos and selfie are checked before the handover. You can check them yourself, for a booking on one of your own jobs today or in the next 7 days. Everything you do is recorded with your name and &quot;field staff&quot;.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">My jobs shows <b class="gd-ui">Licences to check</b> when the licence front, back or selfie of a renter on one of your jobs waits for a decision. The same check is on the job itself, under <b class="gd-ui">Check the licence</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Review the licence</b>. The images open with the name, date of birth and licence details on the booking.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Look at each image: the name and date of birth match the booking, class G2 or G and valid past the return date with no sign of alteration, and the selfie matches the licence photo.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">One is wrong? Open <b class="gd-ui">Reject this one</b> under it, type the reason the renter reads and press <b class="gd-ui">Reject</b>. The renter is told why and sends a new one.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Then press <b class="gd-ui">Approve all</b>: everything still waiting is approved at once.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>The renter&#39;s proof of coverage stays with the office. Meeting the renter at the handover? You can still check the original licence in person from the ready check (see A handover).</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="my-jobs-move-a-car" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Move a car</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Under Vehicle moves, press <b class="gd-ui">Start a move</b>. Choose the Car and Why (for example Reposition).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Fill in From and the Odometer (km), then press <b class="gd-ui">Start the move now</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">When you arrive, press <b class="gd-ui">End the move</b>, fill in Now at and the odometer, then press <b class="gd-ui">End the move now</b>.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="my-jobs-documents-to-sign" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Documents to sign</h2><p class="gd-p">Your staff agreement, when CarmaCars sends it.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">My jobs shows &quot;You have a document to sign&quot;. Press <b class="gd-ui">Read and sign</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Check the key values at the top (your role, wage and start date), then press <b class="gd-ui">Read the PDF</b> and read it.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Sign in a few steps: press <b class="gd-ui">Send the code</b> and type the 6-digit code from your phone or email, tick that you read it, draw your initials beside the key terms (confidentiality, the rules on money, keys and cars, ending the agreement), tick the two consents and draw your signature.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Sign</b>. The signed copy, with its certificate of completion, stays on the same page.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="my-jobs-cars-now" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Cars now</h2><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Field work</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Cars now</b> shows which cars are out, coming back today and tomorrow, going out in the next 72 hours and free, with no money. The renter&#39;s phone shows only on your own jobs.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="my-jobs-call-and-text-the-renter" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Call and text the renter</h2><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Call</b> on a job opens the Quo app with the renter&#39;s number, so the call comes from the CarmaCars number; <b class="gd-ui">Text</b> opens a small window that sends from the CarmaCars number and keeps the text with the booking. Without the Quo app, use <b class="gd-ui">Use this phone</b> in the window that opens.</p></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('field', 'report-rentals-referrals-and-profile', 'chapter', 'academy', 'Report anything that happens on the road, add a rental for a renter you found, share your referral link, and keep your details up to date.

## Report a problem

1. Open **Report a problem** and choose the Car.
2. Choose What happened: **New damage found**, **Warning light**, **Collision while I was driving**, **Ticket or toll while I was driving**, **Lost property found** or **Something else**.
3. Write the Details: where, when and what you see.
4. Press **Take a photo** for each photo, then **Send the report**.

![](/guides/img/field-03-report-phone-3b903b20.jpg "phone; size: 390 1040; pins: 1 93.6 46.6, 2 93.6 64.9, 3 93.6 89.9")

> Watch out: In a collision, make sure everyone is safe and call 911 if anyone is hurt. Then call CarmaCars at 289-312-5991 before you send the report.

## Add a rental for a renter you found

Your home address must be in your profile first: until it is, the page asks for it.

1. Open **Add a rental**. Choose the car, the dates and the places, then type the renter''s details. A renter already on file is found by their email. Car already out with the renter? Enter the pickup as when it left: it is recorded as on trip.
2. Press **Check the calendar and the price**. To charge another price, type it with the reason: a price far under the rate sheet is flagged for an Admin, not refused.
3. Choose **Send a payment link** or **Charge the saved card when the renter signs**. The renter pays online: you take no payment for it yourself.
4. Under Who found this client, choose **I sourced this client** or **Entered for CarmaCars**, then press **Add the rental**.

## Commissions

1. You earn 10% of the rental charge (before tax, after discounts, less refunds) of each rental you sourced: one you added and marked I sourced this client, or a booking made with your referral link.
2. It is earned when the rental is completed and paid in full, then an Admin approves it and it is paid on your pay date. Your home address must be in your profile: until it is, a commission waits as not earned yet.
3. **My sales** shows each commission: not earned yet, pending approval, approved, paid or reversed. A refund after payment comes off a later commission.

## Referrals and profile

1. **Referrals**: your own referral link. Press **Copy the link**, or let someone scan its QR code. A booking made with it counts as a rental you sourced.
2. **Profile**: **Save my phone**, your home address (**Change my home address**), **Set up two-step sign-in**, **Change my password** and **Sign out**.

![](/guides/img/field-04-profile-phone-f05000e2.jpg "phone; size: 390 920; pins: 2 92.3 78.3")

## Sign in with your phone number

Quicker on a phone than a password: a 6-digit code by text.

1. On **Profile**, under Sign-in, press **Add and verify my phone number**, enter your mobile number and press **Text me a code**.
2. Type the code from the text (it usually fills itself in) and press **Verify**. Choose **My phone number (a code by text)** under Sign in with.
3. Next time, the sign-in page opens on your phone number: press **Text me a code** and enter the code. Two-step sign-in still asks for your authenticator code.

## Texts or email

On **Profile**, under **Messages**, choose **Email**, **Text** or **Both** for the messages we send you. Texts need the phone you verified above.

## Phone alerts

Get an alert the moment a job is assigned to you or changes, and when you are paid. Open **Profile**, press **Turn on alerts** under **Phone alerts** and allow notifications. On an iPhone, add CarmaCars to the Home Screen first (Safari, **Share**, **Add to Home Screen**) and turn alerts on from there.
